WEBVTT

00:00:45.546 --> 00:00:48.799
<i>Kokoro egakidasu</i>

00:00:48.799 --> 00:00:52.386
<i>chizujou no michinaru frontier</i>

00:00:52.386 --> 00:00:55.806
<i>Tobira hiraitara</i>

00:00:55.806 --> 00:00:59.142
<i>michi wa tsuzuiteiru yo</i>

00:00:59.142 --> 00:01:05.107
<i>Hokori makiagete kimi no machi e</i>

00:01:05.107 --> 00:01:11.822
<i>Sora to daichi ga kasanaru ruuto de</i>

00:01:11.822 --> 00:01:15.576
<i>Hashiru minamikaze ni notte</i>

00:01:15.576 --> 00:01:18.495
<i>Aoku somaru kaze wo kitte</i>

00:01:18.495 --> 00:01:25.627
<i>Kokorogoto kakedashiteirun da</i>

00:01:25.627 --> 00:01:29.131
<i>Mahiru no tsuki wo oikoshite</i>

00:01:29.131 --> 00:01:32.259
<i>Kinou to wa chigau sekai e</i>

00:01:32.259 --> 00:01:37.681
<i>Dokomademo hashirinuketeku</i>

00:01:37.681 --> 00:01:41.602
<i>Ano kaze no you ni</i>

00:01:42.769 --> 00:01:46.899
<i>Ano kaze no you ni</i>

00:02:01.121 --> 00:02:04.458
"Edge of Heaven"
Ancient Greece. Mediterranean Sea.

00:02:05.542 --> 00:02:07.544
Wei, Wu, Shu.

00:02:07.544 --> 00:02:09.171
Unification under the Jin...

00:02:09.171 --> 00:02:10.255
The Southern and Northern dynasties.

00:02:10.255 --> 00:02:11.423
"Sou"

00:02:11.590 --> 00:02:12.799
Jeez!

00:02:15.344 --> 00:02:17.179
<i>I told him he's going to</i>
<i>end up repeating a grade!</i>

00:02:18.472 --> 00:02:21.308
I'm sorry... I'm late...

00:02:22.726 --> 00:02:25.395
Sagara! You finally decided
to come take the tests<i> now</i>?

00:02:25.395 --> 00:02:27.773
You can't afford to have such
a nonchalant attitude, you know!

00:02:27.773 --> 00:02:28.690
Yes, sir!

00:02:28.690 --> 00:02:32.778
--My apologies. Due to various circumstances...
--That's enough! Just take your seat, now!

00:02:32.778 --> 00:02:34.571
Understood.

00:02:43.622 --> 00:02:46.458
"Sydney"

00:02:47.292 --> 00:02:49.461
Vincent Bruno.

00:02:49.461 --> 00:02:53.382
During the operation at the
Cross-Yangtze River Tunnel a few days ago,

00:02:53.382 --> 00:02:57.928
you leaked information and
disrupted operational maneuvers.

00:02:57.928 --> 00:02:59.555
Is that correct?

00:03:00.597 --> 00:03:02.516
Answer the question!

00:03:03.684 --> 00:03:06.562
I don't know what
you're talking about.

00:03:06.562 --> 00:03:07.396
Do it.

00:03:07.396 --> 00:03:08.480
Yes, sir!

00:03:17.281 --> 00:03:20.409
Do not worry.
This will be the end of it.

00:03:20.409 --> 00:03:22.828
You could break every one of his
fingers and it wouldn't be enough.

00:03:23.620 --> 00:03:25.664
P-Please, stop!

00:03:25.664 --> 00:03:29.585
I understand, I'll tell you
anything you want! So please forgive me!

00:03:29.585 --> 00:03:31.837
The one who leaked
information to the outside

00:03:31.837 --> 00:03:34.423
regarding the Cross-Yangtze
Tunnel operation was you, right?

00:03:34.423 --> 00:03:36.633
Y-Yeah, that's right! It was me!

00:03:36.633 --> 00:03:37.593
Who asked you to do it?

00:03:37.593 --> 00:03:38.969
--I don't know!
--Don't lie!

00:03:38.969 --> 00:03:42.639
Wait! It's the truth!
I really don't know their names!

00:03:42.639 --> 00:03:43.891
They said they were from... umm...

00:03:43.891 --> 00:03:47.853
Amalgam, yeah, Amalgam!

00:03:47.853 --> 00:03:49.271
Amalgam?

00:03:49.271 --> 00:03:53.275
Even I don't know any
more than that. It's the truth!

00:03:53.275 --> 00:03:56.528
I thought they were probably
from the Soviet KGB or something.

00:03:56.528 --> 00:03:58.655
I didn't take it too seriously!

00:03:58.655 --> 00:04:00.699
They paid me $200,000 in advance.

00:04:00.699 --> 00:04:04.661
We're talking $200,000 here!
There was no reason for me to refuse!

00:04:04.661 --> 00:04:06.246
--Let's go.
--So I...

00:04:06.246 --> 00:04:10.584
"Amalgam." An alloy of mercury
with another metal, huh?

00:04:10.584 --> 00:04:13.086
Do you think it's insinuating something?

00:04:13.086 --> 00:04:16.715
Do you mean, considering the fact
that "Mithril" is a fictional metal?

00:04:16.715 --> 00:04:18.467
I don't know.

00:04:18.467 --> 00:04:21.345
But I don't like
that way of doing things.

00:04:21.345 --> 00:04:22.679
The interrogation?

00:04:22.679 --> 00:04:26.683
I can't deny it's unpleasant,
but there was no threat to his life.

00:04:26.683 --> 00:04:29.061
That is certainly true, but still...

00:04:29.061 --> 00:04:29.978
Besides...

00:04:29.978 --> 00:04:32.606
if it had been me,
I would have cut his fingers off.

00:04:34.358 --> 00:04:38.362
The admiral is on the phone right now,
but you may go in, Captain.

00:04:38.362 --> 00:04:41.573
Mr. Jackson, you don't have
to be formal and call me "Captain."

00:04:41.573 --> 00:04:46.537
However, I can't call you "young lady"
like I used to when you were here.

00:04:46.537 --> 00:04:47.788
Yeah, I know.

00:04:47.788 --> 00:04:50.415
We'll clean up our own mess.

00:04:50.415 --> 00:04:54.461
Of course, we'll keep a
record of the interrogation.

00:04:54.461 --> 00:04:55.754
What?

00:04:55.754 --> 00:04:58.465
We should discuss that
problem again at another time.

00:04:58.465 --> 00:05:00.759
I have guests.
I have to go.

00:05:03.053 --> 00:05:05.305
Thanks for coming.
Would you like something to drink?

00:05:05.305 --> 00:05:07.391
Thank you.
I will have water.

00:05:07.391 --> 00:05:08.308
Lieutenant Commander?

00:05:08.308 --> 00:05:09.434
I'll have the same.

00:05:09.434 --> 00:05:11.603
Come on now,
that's so bland.

00:05:13.522 --> 00:05:16.441
That call just now was
from the head of Intelligence.

00:05:16.441 --> 00:05:19.027
Is Intelligence demanding
that we hand over Bruno?

00:05:19.027 --> 00:05:21.572
I refused, of course.

00:05:21.572 --> 00:05:26.743
It seems they can't stand the fact that
we abducted Bruno without permission.

00:05:26.743 --> 00:05:30.122
By the way, did you see
the interrogation on the way here?

00:05:30.122 --> 00:05:31.748
Yes...

00:05:31.748 --> 00:05:34.793
If you want to continue
being the captain of the fleet,

00:05:34.793 --> 00:05:39.715
you need to witness things like that,
and learn something from them.

00:05:39.715 --> 00:05:42.885
That is the kind of path you are on.

00:05:44.678 --> 00:05:48.390
Don't think too hard about it.
You'll understand in time.

00:05:48.390 --> 00:05:50.767
Bruno has begun giving his statement.

00:05:50.767 --> 00:05:51.560
What did he say?

00:05:51.560 --> 00:05:54.771
"Amalgam." It seems to be the
name of an organization.

00:05:54.771 --> 00:05:56.356
Amalgam?

00:05:56.356 --> 00:05:57.774
Have you heard of it before?

00:05:57.774 --> 00:05:59.860
No, however...

00:05:59.860 --> 00:06:01.862
If some kind of organization
we've been unaware of

00:06:01.862 --> 00:06:08.827
was behind the incident at the Perio Islands,
and this incident in Nanking,

00:06:08.827 --> 00:06:14.082
it would probably be necessary to revise
and adjust many of our present policies.

00:06:15.209 --> 00:06:17.628
Meaning?

00:06:17.628 --> 00:06:19.171
First, Kaname Chidori.

00:06:19.171 --> 00:06:22.508
The girl Intelligence
mentioned the other day.

00:06:23.967 --> 00:06:26.094
In light of the "Whispered" incident,

00:06:26.094 --> 00:06:32.392
she is no longer in the stage where she needs
to be treated as "a matter of concern."

00:06:32.392 --> 00:06:34.770
There's the problem of Wraith too.

00:06:35.729 --> 00:06:39.691
Our current way of handling
things is clearly way too inefficient.

00:06:39.691 --> 00:06:41.610
You are quite right, however...

00:06:41.610 --> 00:06:43.070
What?

00:06:43.070 --> 00:06:45.113
What about Sergeant Sagara?

00:06:45.113 --> 00:06:48.408
He has the ARX-7 to deal with too.

00:06:48.408 --> 00:06:50.494
That is important work.

00:06:50.494 --> 00:06:53.580
I think this is the perfect opportunity.

00:06:53.580 --> 00:06:55.457
Do you have any objections?

00:06:58.001 --> 00:06:59.503
No.

00:06:59.753 --> 00:07:00.879
"Jindai Tokyo Municipal High School"

00:07:00.879 --> 00:07:03.841
Did you apologize to Ms. Kagurazaka?

00:07:03.841 --> 00:07:07.010
Yeah. I promised I would
reassemble her car on Sunday.

00:07:07.010 --> 00:07:08.178
Jeez.

00:07:08.178 --> 00:07:10.013
Even if you pass your classes,
it'll be all over if you get expelled

00:07:10.013 --> 00:07:12.683
because of multiple acts of
misconduct or something, you know!

00:07:12.683 --> 00:07:13.433
No doubt about that.

00:07:13.433 --> 00:07:15.060
Don't act like it's
somebody else's problem!

00:07:15.060 --> 00:07:19.773
But Sagara, where did you go
when we were in the middle of tests?

00:07:19.773 --> 00:07:21.650
Something important came up.

00:07:22.943 --> 00:07:26.822
Did it go all right?
It sounded like it was pretty rough...

00:07:26.822 --> 00:07:28.866
No problem.

00:07:28.866 --> 00:07:30.534
I see...

00:07:37.583 --> 00:07:39.751
By the way.

00:07:39.751 --> 00:07:43.088
Sagara, have you been
letting your hair grow lately?

00:07:43.088 --> 00:07:45.549
Now that you mention it,
I think you're right.

00:07:45.549 --> 00:07:46.758
Is it strange?

00:07:46.758 --> 00:07:48.886
No, not really...

00:07:48.886 --> 00:07:52.014
But do you usually
go to a hair salon?

00:07:52.014 --> 00:07:53.515
What's a hair salon?

00:07:53.515 --> 00:07:54.641
A barber.

00:07:54.641 --> 00:07:56.685
No, I always cut my hair myself.

00:07:58.812 --> 00:08:00.230
Yeah, I can see that.

00:08:01.231 --> 00:08:03.817
Hey! I just thought of something.

00:08:03.817 --> 00:08:07.196
Why don't we take Sagara
to a beauty salon?

00:08:07.196 --> 00:08:09.990
We'll give him a
complete image change!

00:08:09.990 --> 00:08:12.242
Beauty salon?
Not a barber?

00:08:12.242 --> 00:08:16.747
Right! If Sagara got more style-conscious
like a normal high school student,

00:08:16.747 --> 00:08:18.498
he might look pretty handsome!

00:08:18.498 --> 00:08:21.293
What? I'm not so sure...

00:08:21.293 --> 00:08:23.170
And in the first place,
there's no way he'd agree to...

00:08:23.170 --> 00:08:25.589
All right, let's go.

00:08:25.589 --> 00:08:29.009
That's where normal high school
students get their hair cut, correct?

00:08:32.262 --> 00:08:33.931
Haircut, please.

00:08:35.057 --> 00:08:36.934
This way, please.

00:08:37.976 --> 00:08:42.898
It's strange seeing Sagara
actually caring about his appearance.

00:08:47.945 --> 00:08:52.741
I'm talking about your
plans for your life, your<i> future</i>!

00:08:52.741 --> 00:08:54.076
You're still just 17 years old, you know?

00:08:54.076 --> 00:08:57.287
Don't you ever think just a
little bit about the future?

00:08:57.287 --> 00:08:59.289
Okay, I'm going to
start the shampooing.

00:09:06.129 --> 00:09:07.339
W-Wait!

00:09:08.590 --> 00:09:10.217
Never mind. Please continue.

00:09:12.427 --> 00:09:15.347
Hey, look! This magazine
has Dakitsuba in it!

00:09:15.347 --> 00:09:17.307
Oh yeah, you're right.

00:09:17.307 --> 00:09:18.976
Do you itch anywhere?

00:09:18.976 --> 00:09:20.811
No.

00:09:20.811 --> 00:09:22.646
<i>I'm completely vulnerable.</i>

00:09:24.064 --> 00:09:25.983
<i>No, don't worry about it.</i>

00:09:25.983 --> 00:09:29.903
<i>This is ordinary soap.</i>
<i>He's an ordinary salon employee.</i>

00:09:30.946 --> 00:09:33.240
<i>I always mess up at this point.</i>

00:09:33.240 --> 00:09:34.825
<i>However...</i>

00:09:34.825 --> 00:09:36.034
This is a towel.

00:09:36.034 --> 00:09:40.914
Towel. Towel. Towel. Towel. Towel.
Towel. Towel. Towel. Towel. Towel.

00:09:40.914 --> 00:09:43.000
Okay, I'm going to start the cut.

00:09:43.000 --> 00:09:47.880
He put the cloth on me so that the
cut hair won't stick to my clothes,

00:09:47.880 --> 00:09:50.007
not to restrict the movement of my arms.

00:09:50.007 --> 00:09:51.008
And these are just ordinary,

00:09:51.008 --> 00:09:52.843
ordinary, ordinary, ordinary sciss...

00:09:54.928 --> 00:09:55.929
Don't move!

00:10:03.353 --> 00:10:04.229
I did it again?

00:10:04.229 --> 00:10:05.606
<i>Sousuke!</i>

00:10:21.705 --> 00:10:25.667
Don't worry, it'll be a
good turning point for him.

00:10:25.667 --> 00:10:27.878
It is my fault.

00:10:33.300 --> 00:10:35.677
You're the one who
asked me to take you, you know!

00:10:35.677 --> 00:10:37.387
Why did you freak out like that?

00:10:37.387 --> 00:10:39.097
I'm sorry.

00:10:39.097 --> 00:10:41.099
We got kicked out of the salon,

00:10:41.099 --> 00:10:43.852
and they even treated
<i>me </i>like a crazy delinquent!

00:10:43.852 --> 00:10:46.522
But it is just too dangerous
to be that vulnerable

00:10:46.522 --> 00:10:48.899
in front of a complete
stranger holding a blade.

00:10:48.899 --> 00:10:50.067
Oh, is that right?

00:10:50.067 --> 00:10:52.736
Then don't say you're
going to the beauty salon!

00:10:52.736 --> 00:10:54.238
Are you telling me you
didn't think from the start

00:10:54.238 --> 00:10:56.240
that you'd react that
way to getting a haircut?

00:10:56.240 --> 00:11:00.744
One wrong move and a completely innocent
employee would have been seriously hurt!

00:11:00.744 --> 00:11:05.249
Why don't you stop thinking everyone's
an assassin or an enemy once in a while!

00:11:05.249 --> 00:11:09.127
I cannot do that.
There are enemies. That is a fact.

00:11:09.127 --> 00:11:11.797
It wouldn't be surprising if
they attacked you at any time.

00:11:11.797 --> 00:11:13.131
That's...

00:11:13.131 --> 00:11:17.302
My top priority here is to
protect you from the enemy.

00:11:20.222 --> 00:11:22.766
However...

00:11:22.766 --> 00:11:24.935
It's been six months
since I've come here,

00:11:24.935 --> 00:11:28.355
and my instincts are often off.

00:11:28.355 --> 00:11:31.900
I haven't been able to adapt to this place,
and that is another fact.

00:11:31.900 --> 00:11:34.111
All I do is cause
problems for everyone.

00:11:35.237 --> 00:11:38.240
Of course, that means you too.

00:11:42.536 --> 00:11:45.122
So it's been six months already?

00:11:52.754 --> 00:11:56.925
You haven't made any
progress at all, that's for sure.

00:11:56.925 --> 00:11:59.178
Is that right...

00:11:59.178 --> 00:12:00.804
It sure is!

00:12:06.894 --> 00:12:09.146
Listen...

00:12:09.146 --> 00:12:11.064
Why don't you come to my place?

00:12:11.064 --> 00:12:15.027
I'll finish cutting
your hair for you.

00:12:16.195 --> 00:12:16.862
No?

00:12:16.862 --> 00:12:19.031
No, it's just...

00:12:19.031 --> 00:12:20.657
Are you worried even about me?

00:12:20.657 --> 00:12:24.369
No, not at all.
You're different.

00:12:31.793 --> 00:12:35.214
Okay, sir! What kind of cut would you like?

00:12:37.758 --> 00:12:38.967
Is it too tight?

00:12:38.967 --> 00:12:40.093
No, no problem.

00:12:43.639 --> 00:12:46.266
All right, here we go!

00:12:49.770 --> 00:12:50.270
Chidori.

00:12:50.270 --> 00:12:51.271
What?

00:12:51.271 --> 00:12:53.190
Do you have any
experience cutting hair?

00:12:53.190 --> 00:12:54.149
Not at all.

00:12:56.944 --> 00:13:00.822
Well, I've played
around with Kyoko's hair,

00:13:00.822 --> 00:13:03.283
but I guess this will be my
first time actually cutting.

00:13:03.283 --> 00:13:05.035
It'll be all right.

00:13:05.035 --> 00:13:07.913
This is better than
cutting it yourself, isn't it?

00:13:07.913 --> 00:13:10.082
Please don't cut off my ears.

00:13:10.082 --> 00:13:12.334
I'll try my best not to.

00:13:25.097 --> 00:13:26.223
Hey, listen...

00:13:26.223 --> 00:13:28.183
What is it?

00:13:28.183 --> 00:13:31.937
You skipped the tests
because of your work, right?

00:13:31.937 --> 00:13:33.522
Yeah.

00:13:33.522 --> 00:13:35.732
Did you fight again?

00:13:35.732 --> 00:13:36.859
Yeah.

00:13:36.859 --> 00:13:37.943
Is there a problem?

00:13:37.943 --> 00:13:39.862
Not really.

00:13:39.862 --> 00:13:41.864
You weren't hurt, right?

00:13:41.864 --> 00:13:46.034
Only light wounds.
Not a problem.

00:13:46.034 --> 00:13:47.369
I see...

00:14:24.615 --> 00:14:26.200
You know, Sousuke,

00:14:26.200 --> 00:14:28.619
hasn't someone been looking
around really restlessly lately?

00:14:28.619 --> 00:14:30.204
Who?

00:14:30.204 --> 00:14:31.288
You, Sousuke.

00:14:31.288 --> 00:14:32.206
I have?

00:14:32.206 --> 00:14:35.167
Yes, you have.
You were doing it again today.

00:14:35.167 --> 00:14:37.211
No, it's your imagination.

00:14:39.213 --> 00:14:42.174
You're probably being cautious
because of all the fuss

00:14:42.174 --> 00:14:45.093
about that stalker the other day, but...

00:14:46.637 --> 00:14:51.266
Or am I being targeted again?

00:14:51.266 --> 00:14:53.602
Why do you ask that?

00:14:53.602 --> 00:14:55.187
No particular reason...

00:14:55.187 --> 00:14:58.148
But, a lot has happened up until now.

00:15:02.319 --> 00:15:04.238
Don't worry.
It's not an enemy.

00:15:04.238 --> 00:15:07.991
There is another person
assigned to you as a backup.

00:15:07.991 --> 00:15:10.494
Is it someone I know? Like Kurz?

00:15:10.494 --> 00:15:13.038
No. There's no way
you'd know this person.

00:15:13.038 --> 00:15:15.040
In fact, even I don't know him.

00:15:15.040 --> 00:15:16.416
I see...

00:15:16.416 --> 00:15:18.961
His true identity is unknown.

00:15:18.961 --> 00:15:22.214
He never shows himself.
That's the agreement.

00:15:22.214 --> 00:15:26.468
I wonder if he wouldn't come to help me,
even if I were attacked.

00:15:34.017 --> 00:15:36.353
You know, Sousuke...

00:15:36.353 --> 00:15:40.148
Even if I can't trust anyone else,
I do trust<i> you</i>.

00:15:44.111 --> 00:15:46.280
Thank you.

00:15:46.280 --> 00:15:48.365
You're welcome.

00:15:51.159 --> 00:15:53.203
Could you look to the
right a little more?

00:15:53.203 --> 00:15:54.121
Yeah.

00:15:54.121 --> 00:15:56.081
Not that way,
the other way.

00:16:06.258 --> 00:16:10.262
Hmm, I think I'm
getting the hang of this.

00:16:18.395 --> 00:16:20.689
There, done!

00:16:45.088 --> 00:16:47.090
Okay, now I'm going to rinse!

00:16:56.683 --> 00:17:00.604
Hey, what's going on?
You're not scheduled to sortie today...

00:17:02.648 --> 00:17:05.859
Hey, stop it...

00:17:05.859 --> 00:17:08.946
What's with this, using your
feminine charms all of a sudden...

00:17:10.280 --> 00:17:13.325
All right, I'll be there later.

00:17:28.423 --> 00:17:31.385
Whaa? My little kitties skipped town?

00:17:31.385 --> 00:17:33.679
What in the hell kind of problem
did they have with me?

00:17:33.679 --> 00:17:35.681
Even if they<i> are </i>under age,
I never slacked off!

00:17:35.681 --> 00:17:38.141
I made sure they were satisfied!

00:17:38.141 --> 00:17:39.726
I do not know about that,

00:17:39.726 --> 00:17:42.062
however, they have stolen one Codarl M,

00:17:42.062 --> 00:17:43.605
--and are on the run!
--Huh? What did you say?

00:17:43.605 --> 00:17:47.067
Oh, come on! It's no use talking to you!

00:17:47.067 --> 00:17:47.776
--Put them on the line!

00:17:47.776 --> 00:17:49.778
--Yes sir! I'll switch you over.
--Put them on the line!

00:17:55.325 --> 00:17:58.495
You can hear me, right,
you naughty little Lolitas?

00:17:58.495 --> 00:18:01.206
Just what do you think you're doing?

00:18:01.206 --> 00:18:02.583
Did you want something?

00:18:02.583 --> 00:18:06.879
Where do you think you're going off
to play with that expensive toy?

00:18:06.879 --> 00:18:09.548
Does it matter?

00:18:09.548 --> 00:18:13.051
From now on, we are
going to do as we please.

00:18:13.719 --> 00:18:15.929
Who ordered you to do this?

00:18:15.929 --> 00:18:20.642
You're not taking that thing with you
to go say "hello" to Mithril, are you?

00:18:20.642 --> 00:18:23.353
Of course we are.

00:18:23.353 --> 00:18:27.191
To kill them, for Sensei.

00:18:30.777 --> 00:18:31.778
<i>Pow</i>!

00:18:35.490 --> 00:18:37.743
I'm sorry it's just
leftovers from yesterday.

00:18:37.743 --> 00:18:39.620
No, I'm grateful.

00:18:43.874 --> 00:18:44.750
Wha'ff wrong?

00:18:44.750 --> 00:18:46.543
Huh? Nothing...

00:18:48.712 --> 00:18:53.509
Listen, it seems like you're always
walking around with scary weapons...

00:18:53.509 --> 00:18:55.302
Yeah.

00:18:55.302 --> 00:18:57.721
Do you have any
that are gentler, and safer?

00:18:57.721 --> 00:18:59.556
You see,

00:18:59.556 --> 00:19:02.309
I was kind of thinking
about carrying one around.

00:19:02.309 --> 00:19:04.478
I see. That's a good mind-set.

00:19:05.854 --> 00:19:13.570
Keep tear gas, handcuffs, a flashlight,
and a disposable stun gun close at hand.

00:19:13.570 --> 00:19:16.198
As usual, I have no idea
where you keep that stuff.

00:19:16.198 --> 00:19:19.326
But isn't even this pretty dangerous?

00:19:19.326 --> 00:19:20.452
The person won't die, will he?

00:19:20.452 --> 00:19:23.455
Tens of thousands of volts of
electricity flow through the wires,

00:19:23.455 --> 00:19:25.499
but only for a moment.

00:19:25.499 --> 00:19:27.459
A normal man won't die from it.

00:19:27.459 --> 00:19:32.339
But that's a normal man, right?
What about a woman, or a child?

00:19:32.339 --> 00:19:33.549
Chidori,

00:19:33.549 --> 00:19:36.343
you cannot afford to have
mercy in such a situation.

00:19:36.343 --> 00:19:40.305
Only someone third-rate would
lick his lips in front of the prey.

00:19:40.305 --> 00:19:43.809
After all, no creature
could survive like that.

00:19:46.937 --> 00:19:49.648
I'm very grateful
for everything today.

00:19:49.648 --> 00:19:52.568
Next time, if there's an opportunity,
I will cut your hair.

00:19:52.568 --> 00:19:54.361
Absolutely not!

00:19:58.365 --> 00:20:01.368
You'll have to surprise Kyoko tomorrow.

00:20:01.368 --> 00:20:03.871
You're right.

00:20:03.871 --> 00:20:06.623
And don't forget to
return that notebook, okay?

00:20:06.623 --> 00:20:09.668
Of course. I couldn't be
more thankful for everything.

00:20:09.668 --> 00:20:13.839
If you forget it like you did before,
you'll have to go get it back yourself!

00:20:13.839 --> 00:20:16.592
No, I absolutely will
not forget it this time.

00:20:16.592 --> 00:20:17.885
Right.

00:20:23.682 --> 00:20:25.601
Well then, I should be going.

00:20:25.601 --> 00:20:28.228
Yeah. See you later.

00:20:28.228 --> 00:20:29.688
See you tomorrow.

00:20:41.491 --> 00:20:44.244
Maybe next time I'll pick
out some clothes for him, too.

00:20:59.760 --> 00:21:02.930
Even if I can't trust anyone else,
I do trust<i> you</i>.

00:21:05.641 --> 00:21:06.683
Okay.

00:22:27.764 --> 00:22:33.312
<i>Kitto kimi wa kyou no hi mo</i>

00:22:33.312 --> 00:22:39.193
<i>Massugu ashita wo miteru</i>

00:22:39.193 --> 00:22:44.907
<i>Kaze ga fuku ano oka ni saita</i>

00:22:44.907 --> 00:22:51.663
<i>himawari no you ni</i>

00:22:53.582 --> 00:22:59.505
<i>Donna ni tooku hanareteite mo</i>

00:22:59.505 --> 00:23:05.511
<i>Kono utagoe ga kimi ni todoku you ni</i>

00:23:05.511 --> 00:23:11.558
<i>Namida ga zutto tomaranai yoru</i>

00:23:11.558 --> 00:23:17.898
<i>Kimi no mado wo terasu tsuki ni naritai</i>

00:23:17.898 --> 00:23:25.948
<i>Mata kanarazu aeru to</i>

00:23:28.283 --> 00:23:31.870
<i>Sou omou kara</i>

00:23:45.175 --> 00:23:46.009
"Next Episode"

00:23:46.009 --> 00:23:47.928
<i>I didn't consider myself</i>
<i>to have run away.</i>

00:23:47.928 --> 00:23:50.097
<i>And it wasn't that I abandoned her, either.</i>

00:23:50.097 --> 00:23:51.849
<i>An ominous order.</i>

00:23:51.849 --> 00:23:54.142
<i>A bitter exchange of words with a ghost.</i>

00:23:54.142 --> 00:23:57.187
<i>Next time: "Left Behind."</i>

00:23:57.187 --> 00:23:59.731
<i>Unable to dispute the solid pronouncement,</i>

00:23:59.731 --> 00:24:04.715
<i>only helplessness is left in my heart.</i>
